OL,3,GNEWSAElectric motorbike rider jailed
OL,4,Aafter crashing into police officer
OL,5,Awhile fleeing arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been sentenced to 21 months
OL,8,Fin jail following a crash with a police
OL,9,Fofficer while using an electric
OL,10,Fmotorbike.
OL,12,FJake Fernandes, 25, was sentenced for
OL,13,Ffive offences after his bike, bags of
OL,14,Fcannabis and cash were seized.
OL,16,FIt happened on Amroth Road in Caerau,
OL,17,FCardiff, at about 20:30 BST on 11
OL,18,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
