OL,3,GNEWSAElectric motorbike rider jailed
OL,4,Aafter crashing into police officer
OL,5,Awhile fleeing arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FRecorder Robin Rouch who oversaw the
OL,8,Fsentencing said the 25-year-old had
OL,9,Ftried to evade arrest and by doing so
OL,10,Fcaused the officer injury.
